keywords:
  - covering arrays
  - combinatorial designs
  - combinatorial testing
  - local search
  - linear codes
  - group actions
  - LLM-written search programs
abstract: "Explicit covering arrays for 80 parameter sets of the ca-tools covering array table, at strengths 3, 4 and 5; 77 of them hold the best known size on 2026-11-04, including CA(6445; 4, 37, 6) (previous best 7199), CA(2976; 4, 12, 6) (3944), CA(2976; 4, 11, 6) (3671) and the line CA(N; 4, k, 6) for k = 11 to 39. Obtained by orbit search under PGL(2, q), a family developed under PGL(2, 5) and a cyclic shift of the columns, unions of cosets of linear codes and post-optimisation of the published record arrays, with search programs written by Claude Opus, and verified exhaustively."
